  "description": "The \u0027dss_users_cached\u0027 dataset is a comprehensive collection of user-related data, primarily used for managing and analyzing user profiles within a system. It includes essential information such as user login details, display names, email addresses, and user profiles, which are crucial for identifying and authenticating users. The dataset also tracks user group memberships, source types, and whether the user account is enabled, providing insights into user roles and permissions. Additionally, it records timestamps for account creation, last successful login, and last session activity, which are vital for monitoring user engagement and activity patterns. The inclusion of URLs for user profile management and the resulting user profile data further enhances its utility for administrative purposes. This dataset is particularly useful for system administrators and data analysts who need to manage user access, analyze user behavior, and ensure security compliance within an organization. Its structured format allows for efficient querying and reporting, making it a valuable resource for user management and auditing processes.",
